WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.200
Mr.

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.034
Ambassador, thank you

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.469
so much for joining us today.

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.137
I do want to begin this conversation

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.472
by asking you to respond

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.774
to this Bloomberg headline

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.542
that is reporting that in the Saint

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.144
Petersburg Forum, President

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:12.512
Putin has said

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.313
that the country

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:14.280
has transferred

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.883
their first nuclear weapons to Belarus.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.953
What is your response to that?

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.988
This is a very, very serious situation.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.923
And by this gesture,

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:24.691
by this step,

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:25.792
he is destroying the

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.060
what is the rest

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.728
of from the international law

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.295
and agreements.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.063
If you remember,

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.264
us, more than double

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:32.966
the Russians and Kazakhs.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:34.734
We are signing this Budapest memorandum

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.503
that we were laying down

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.570
the nuclear weapons.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.605
In return,

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.740
we will be defended against anybody

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:41.775
who can come to us.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:42.475
The Russians

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.911
obviously did not respect this with us,

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.180
but rearm in Belarus.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.748
It's another

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.750
just another blood in violation

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.452
of the international agreements.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:54.087
I believe that we have to take it

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.855
very, very seriously.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:56.689
Does Ukraine view

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.191
this as a sign of warning,

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.193
perhaps from Vladimir Putin, a threat

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:03.363
that he could use nuclear weapons,

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.131
possibly tactical nuclear weapons

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.200
in the months ahead?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.035
I believe that he was blackmailing

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.270
all of us

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.371
Ukrainians, first of all,

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:12.906
by the Europeans and Americans

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.774
of all our partners

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:15.575
around the globe,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.610
that at the end of the day,

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.212
if he is cornered

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.413
he will use some some

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.714
some as like in this case,

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:22.982
the nuclear weapons.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.584
And that's what he's doing.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:25.452
He's bringing

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.754
or at least promising to bring to.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.222
But I have to tell you, that

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:29.756
until now,

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:30.190
we much

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:31.024
better equipped

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:32.492
to withstand this pressure

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:34.094
with all this anti-air missiles,

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:36.329
which we're receiving from our partners.

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:38.398
We are down in everything

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:40.533
sometimes on the level of 100%.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.535
So he has to be extremely careful

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.337
what he's planning because who knows?

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.406
If you send something away, it might

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:47.240
get to the point.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:49.909
Let me ask you about

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:50.877
this counteroffensive.

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:51.411
It appears

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:52.679
we are now in week

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:53.580
at the end of week one

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.748
or two of this counteroffensive.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:59.853
And it's unusual how Mum Ukraine has been

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.788
on any of the roads that it may

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.957
or may not have made at this point.

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:05.959
Characteristically and no surprise,

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.795
Russia has been publicly claiming

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:11.598
that Ukraine has not been successful

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:12.732
thus far.

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:13.333
Give us

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:14.567
the current state

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.970
of this counteroffensive

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:18.872
Obviously, everybody knew

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:19.672
that we would come

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:21.474
as soon as the ground

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:22.175
solid enough

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:22.976
to withstand

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:24.844
the heavy Western tanks

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:26.212
and our own tanks.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:27.280
And it's not a big secret

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.781
that we were waiting

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:30.416
for the perfect moment.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:31.818
And I guess this first one

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:33.920
is really right in front of us.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.188
It's not yet.

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:37.357
We have not engaged in committed

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.758
all the forces we have.

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:39.792
We have pulled in trying

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:42.028
to find the best place for that site.

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.564
The dam, which was destroyed by Russians,

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.665
is changing our guard.

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:46.366
It's a bit

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:48.034
we have to replant our replant

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:49.569
our operation because the do

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:51.137
the part of this huge

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:52.572
thousand kilometer front

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:53.506
is not accessible

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.308
for the heavy equipment.

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:56.743
So this is delaying

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:58.244
our comprehensive bid.

00:02:58.244 --> 00:02:59.913
But I guess the Russians have to wait

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.581
just a couple of days more.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:02.549
So is it fair to say

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:04.250
this is still the probing stage

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.818
because we know that that Ukraine hasn't

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.987
committed the bulk of its forces yet?

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:08.588
Early gains

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:09.222
that have been made

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.591
are clearly not insignificant.

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:14.994
But we have seen images of damaged U.S.

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:16.362
Bradley Armored vehicles,

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:18.598
as well as leopard tanks

00:03:18.598 --> 00:03:21.000
in this fighting, already suggesting

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:21.935
that these heavier

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:23.703
equipped, more sophisticated

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.572
weapons are being used

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:28.208
This is true.

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:28.775
We've never

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:30.577
promised that we will come

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:32.212
and go all the way

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:33.646
without losing some tanks

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:36.015
or very important to some people as well.

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.650
This is painful to see this thing.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.118
But at the same time,

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:40.286
you've seen a couple

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:41.321
of these pieces

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:42.021
being repaired

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.923
and returned back to the front lines,

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:46.392
which means there is no perfect solution.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:49.462
This battle will will cost us a lot.

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:51.364
And whatever we're gaining

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:53.466
is just preliminary attacks,

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:55.101
allowing us to understand

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:56.836
and see all of this

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:57.570
very much

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.972
a political meaning

00:03:58.972 --> 00:04:00.540
and political value as well.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.575
I understand that expectations are high,

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.410
but this is sometimes playing

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.945
very tricky game on us

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:07.647
and our partners around the globe.

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:09.315
We want them to be careful

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:10.650
and patient with us.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.785
This is not the last counteroffensive

00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:14.687
we might have with Russians.

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:16.256
Obviously, I also understand

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:19.525
that the picturesque sort of success

00:04:19.826 --> 00:04:21.661
will reenergize

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:23.196
the assistance around the globe.

00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:24.163
That's what we need.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:25.365
If you want to help the return

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:27.300
on investment into Ukraine,

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.334
maybe we have seen

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:29.602
to increase this investment,

00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:32.038
give more tanks to allow us direct hits.

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:34.574
In the particular points, we will find

00:04:34.574 --> 00:04:35.708
You have made this point

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:36.409
about being a bit

00:04:36.409 --> 00:04:38.611
frustrated with the level of expectations

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.812
that have been set by many

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:40.413
in the media

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:41.714
and many

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:43.216
of Ukraine's supporters

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:45.451
in terms of the significance

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:46.953
of this counteroffensive,

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:48.921
perhaps setting the bar as high

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:51.157
as what we saw around Kharkiv.

00:04:51.157 --> 00:04:52.125
Should people expect

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:52.925
to see more of

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:54.661
what happened around here, son?

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:56.896
And how worried are you at

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:59.899
the possibility that continued support

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:01.868
really hinges on the outcome

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:03.503
of this specific counteroffensive?

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:05.605
You know, even even

00:05:05.605 --> 00:05:07.607
even here, small operation is actually

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:08.741
was quite successful

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:10.843
because here was the only

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:11.911
significant city

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:13.413
the Russians managed to get

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:15.148
from the very beginning of the war.

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.015
So did

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:18.184
the fact that they sort of

00:05:18.184 --> 00:05:19.786
got back out of it.

00:05:19.786 --> 00:05:21.854
Preserving their lives is not that

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:24.290
until we are knowing that we are free.

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:25.458
Our also

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:28.294
our aim of this whole war is not to kill

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:29.929
maximal Russian soldiers

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.798
or kill the maximal Russian things

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:33.800
is just to get them out of our land

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:34.767
and then decide

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:35.768
how we live with them

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:37.303
for the centuries to come.

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:39.238
So the current deliberation, I agree

00:05:39.238 --> 00:05:41.207
it was spectacular, the cold.

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:43.109
But the Russians also learned

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:44.577
from their own mistakes.

00:05:44.577 --> 00:05:46.045
I guess this operation

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:47.146
will allow them

00:05:47.146 --> 00:05:48.381
to dig really deep

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:50.516
and then prepare their defenses.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.151
We have to be much smarter.

00:05:52.151 --> 00:05:54.454
We don't want to repeat their losses,

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:55.988
which they had at the bottom

00:05:55.988 --> 00:05:56.489
in the round

00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:57.123
when their tanks

00:05:57.123 --> 00:05:58.991
were just going through the land

00:05:58.991 --> 00:06:00.293
lengths of mines

00:06:00.293 --> 00:06:01.461
and blowing them in the way.

00:06:01.461 --> 00:06:02.595
So that's what we have to

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:05.164
we have to be much more sort of clever.

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:06.299
It does appear that

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:08.601
Russia appears to be more more competent

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:10.103
in terms of defense

00:06:10.103 --> 00:06:11.137
as opposed to

00:06:11.137 --> 00:06:12.772
their offensive operations

00:06:12.772 --> 00:06:14.841
earlier in this year.

00:06:14.841 --> 00:06:16.342
How how much of a game

00:06:16.342 --> 00:06:18.678
changer would additional long,

00:06:19.345 --> 00:06:22.749
long range missiles and more F-16s

00:06:22.749 --> 00:06:25.818
or any F-16s at this point really be

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:27.120
at this stage of the battle?

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:28.955
First of all,

00:06:28.955 --> 00:06:31.023
the strength of any defensive forces

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:32.558
is the logistics.

00:06:32.558 --> 00:06:35.261
That's the deterrence was not needed,

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:36.195
the bunkers

00:06:36.195 --> 00:06:38.097
needed, the training soldiers

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:40.066
and the numbers of them are important,

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:40.500
but they should

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.134
and this is important

00:06:41.134 --> 00:06:42.468
how fast you're bringing

00:06:42.468 --> 00:06:43.703
the artillery shells

00:06:43.703 --> 00:06:44.837
to the to the frontlines

00:06:44.837 --> 00:06:46.339
and low enough forces to shoot

00:06:46.339 --> 00:06:48.574
at the upcoming offensive.

00:06:48.841 --> 00:06:49.609
So that's what

00:06:49.609 --> 00:06:51.277
we are trying to resolve with the

00:06:51.277 --> 00:06:53.413
with British soldiers.

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:55.248
We will need somebody else,

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:56.816
our partners, to come in

00:06:56.816 --> 00:06:58.017
the United States

00:06:58.017 --> 00:06:58.651
with some sort

00:06:58.651 --> 00:07:00.753
which would allow us to target innocent

00:07:00.753 --> 00:07:02.155
on our own territory.

00:07:02.155 --> 00:07:05.291
And that's the longest F-16s without the.

00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:07.193
That was the failure of Russian attack.

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:08.428
They could not establish

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:09.595
the air superiority

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:12.265
over the whole period of of of war.

00:07:12.532 --> 00:07:15.802
The F-16s or any other Western planes

00:07:15.935 --> 00:07:17.737
would allow us to, first of all,

00:07:17.737 --> 00:07:19.772
deny them from our skies

00:07:19.906 --> 00:07:20.573
and hopefully

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.442
to establish our own superiority

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:24.644
by this moment if it managed to do so.

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:25.812
The war will dictate.

00:07:25.812 --> 00:07:27.747
A war will result.

00:07:27.747 --> 00:07:29.882
Looking at the longer term goals here

00:07:29.882 --> 00:07:31.651
for Ukraine, obviously,

00:07:31.651 --> 00:07:33.719
first and foremost after defeating

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:36.122
Russia would be to join NATO.

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:38.424
And we have seen the defense chiefs

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:40.860
meet in Brussels yesterday

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.296
as far as a line meant that naito

00:07:43.296 --> 00:07:43.863
that Ukraine

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:44.697
will join Naito

00:07:44.697 --> 00:07:46.466
at some point in the future,

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:48.501
they are all aligned on that line.

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:50.169
But when they will join

00:07:50.169 --> 00:07:51.270
when Ukraine can

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.172
join is the big question mark here.

00:07:53.172 --> 00:07:55.174
And we don't really have a timetable

00:07:55.174 --> 00:07:57.076
even set by President Biden.

00:07:58.478 --> 00:07:59.846
There does seem to be

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:01.380
this alternative model

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.582
that it doesn't have to be

00:08:02.582 --> 00:08:04.684
an all or nothing scenario

00:08:04.684 --> 00:08:06.853
that Ukraine could go by way of Israel

00:08:06.853 --> 00:08:08.387
perhaps, or even Taiwan

00:08:08.387 --> 00:08:09.856
would not officially

00:08:09.856 --> 00:08:10.823
joining

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:12.992
any sort of membership or alliance,

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:15.661
but getting all of the weaponry

00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:18.531
and supplies in order to protect itself.

00:08:18.531 --> 00:08:21.901
Would Ukraine settle for that right now?

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:24.270
I believe that it's a bit incorrect

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.239
as a comparison because Taiwan and Israel

00:08:26.239 --> 00:08:27.740
are not part

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.775
of the sort of nodes

00:08:29.775 --> 00:08:32.178
in the Atlantic region where Ukraine is.

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:34.680
So I guess in the way it is right away,

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.549
I was closer

00:08:36.549 --> 00:08:38.317
if they would be in the alliance as well.

00:08:38.317 --> 00:08:39.752
So that was a decision

00:08:39.752 --> 00:08:40.453
which was done

00:08:40.453 --> 00:08:41.787
rather out of necessity

00:08:41.787 --> 00:08:43.389
and geographical necessity.

00:08:43.389 --> 00:08:44.924
So I would not expect

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:45.958
our friendship partners

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:47.627
to invent something

00:08:47.627 --> 00:08:49.462
new and unique for Ukraine

00:08:49.462 --> 00:08:51.697
if we have such a proven mechanism,

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:53.099
an instrument as a nation.

00:08:53.099 --> 00:08:53.799
And Ukraine

00:08:53.799 --> 00:08:54.300
was trying

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.635
to get into the alliance for years

00:08:55.635 --> 00:08:56.402
and years.

00:08:56.402 --> 00:08:58.704
I understand that for some of the members

00:08:58.905 --> 00:09:00.973
it is difficult for their own reasons.

00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:02.808
But I guess the Ukraine is proving

00:09:02.808 --> 00:09:03.509
that's actually

00:09:03.509 --> 00:09:04.710
can be a donor

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.546
of the allies of security

00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:07.980
